    "description": "Step into your Russian Hill dream home where breathtaking San Francisco Bay vistas meet unparalleled serenity nestled beside historic Ina Coolbrith Park. The remodeled vacant unit is in its own separate house, and features a contemporary new kitchen, a large exclusive-use deck off the living room perfect for indoor/outdoor living. Enjoy captivating panoramas of the City's skyline and iconic views. This home is perfect for an owner-occupier, as a primary or vacation home or as a profitable investment property with growth and equity potential. This property has multiple separate additional units. The unique Russian Hill location is moments from a charming cable car line, and is minutes from world-class restaurants and boutique shopping in nearby North Beach, Nob Hill and the Financial District. The sky is the limit for rent in the vacant separate house, Unit 950! The rents in the separate additional occupied units on this lot are very desirable too. Large capital improvements completed in 2025 include brand new roofs on both buildings, new electric panels for the entire property and expansive new decks!"
